--- !u!114 &1163391208
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1163391206}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6640d0b7014bcf743ac082c8476883b3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UI_SpeechBubbleManager
  messageText: {fileID: 2014920998}
  talkingAudioSource: {fileID: 0}
  interactionVisual: {fileID: 1361463955}
  speechBubbleContainer: {fileID: 642143343}
  playerTransform: {fileID: 1876935962}
  activationRadius: 5
  exitRadiusCooldown: 2
  cooldownTime: 3
  typingSpeed: 0.02
  messageArray:
  - I know... I travel quickly, right? With the Speed of Light.
  - I apologize if that startles you.
  - Since you asked me for help, I shall grant guidance.
  - There are places in the World
  - ...some more <color=#00E2FB>hidden</color> than others...
  - where you can find very special <color=#00E2FB>Leafs</color>.
  - They have been brushed by the oldest Winds of the World.
  - If you find them, touch them.
  - You can talk to me. So ...
  - ...you should be able to listen to the stories of the Wind...
  - 'They will tell you more about our World. '
  - 'The World it once was... '
  - ... and maybe can become again.
  - They will also make you stronger. And aid you,
  - in withstanding the Dangers of this World.
  - The now dead World. <br>Only inhabited
  - by Ghosts.
  - <color=yellow>When you collect </color><color=#00E2FB>Wind Leafs</color><color=yellow>,
    you sometimes</color>
  - <color=yellow>unlock </color><color=#00E2FB>Stories Of The Wind</color><color=yellow>
    in the </color><color=#00E2FB>Main Menu</color><color=yellow>.</color>
  - <color=yellow>Collecting 4 </color><color=#00E2FB>Wind Leafs</color><color=yellow>
    also gives you one more</i><color=#00E2FB> Heart</color><color=yellow>.</color>
